{"type":"message","id":"4688c1d1","parentId":"97be9744","timestamp":"2026-05-26T15:04:12.752Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_39aac02f286e498a886180b6","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Cloudflare Workers error code 1101\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1726,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6a1f0c9f6b38b61d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nError 1101 · Cloudflare Support docs\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6a1f0c9f6b38b61d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developers.cloudflare.com/support/troubleshooting/http-status-codes/cloudflare-1xxx-errors/error-1101/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"180c346887c6a5a2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTroubleshoot Cloudflare 1101 error code . This error typically occurs when a Cloudflare Worker encounters a runtime JavaScript exception.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"180c346887c6a5a2\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"developers.cloudflare.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7b3512642030f455\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFix Cloudflare Error 1101 - Worker Exception Solution\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7b3512642030f455\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.fdaytalk.com/cloudflare-error-1101/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"773d470392399946\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nError 1101 is a clear sign that your Cloudflare Worker has encountered an unhandled exception. By methodically reviewing your Worker's logs, debugging your code locally, and following the troubleshooting steps provided above, you can identify and fix the underlying issue.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"773d470392399946\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.fdaytalk.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e90910eedd1e28a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHow to Fix CloudFlare Error 1101 (Worker threw exception)?\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e90910eedd1e28a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://helloacm.com/how-to-fix-cloudflare-error-1101-worker-threw-exception/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"496e057474bc2554\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHow to Fix CloudFlare Error 1101 ( Worker threw exception)? This usually happens, when the script throws a Javascript exception, and can be handled by Try-Catch.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"496e057474bc2554\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"helloacm.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"87ad82aa0e745c58\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCloudflare Workers & Pages 报错 Error 1101 详解 | CMLiussss Blog\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"87ad82aa0e745c58\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.cmliussss.com/p/CF1101/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"73e5d276173e8bc0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2.请求次数审查 当 总请求次数达到11万 左右时， CF会对项目代码进行审查。如果 代码审查未通过，项目将 报错 1101 （代码混淆可能会增加审查不通过的风险），项目名称会被加入CF的 项目名称黑名单，自定义域大概率也会被加入 域名黑名单。 处理方法 使用 Workers 部署项目 （Workers项目有10万次的 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"73e5d276173e8bc0\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"blog.cmliussss.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"649f493b970aaf68\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCloudflare \\\"Error 1101: Worker Threw Exception\\\" - How ... - Bobcares\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"649f493b970aaf68\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://bobcares.com/blog/cloudflare-error-1101-worker-threw-exception/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8772c9d8aecfa11d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWorker Threw Exception\\\" occurs when Cloudflare Worker is throwing a runtime JavaScript exception. Here at Bobcares, we often handle requests from our customers using Cloudflare to fix similar errors as a part of our Server Management Services.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8772c9d8aecfa11d\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"bobcares.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"Cloudflare Workers error code 1101","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":1726,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6a1f0c9f6b38b61d\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nError 1101 · Cloudflare Support docs\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6a1f0c9f6b38b61d\">>>","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/support/troubleshooting/http-status-codes/cloudflare-1xxx-errors/error-1101/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"180c346887c6a5a2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTroubleshoot Cloudflare 1101 error code . This error typically occurs when a Cloudflare Worker encounters a runtime JavaScript exception.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"180c346887c6a5a2\">>>","siteName":"developers.cloudflare.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7b3512642030f455\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nFix Cloudflare Error 1101 - Worker Exception Solution\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7b3512642030f455\">>>","url":"https://www.fdaytalk.com/cloudflare-error-1101/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"773d470392399946\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nError 1101 is a clear sign that your Cloudflare Worker has encountered an unhandled exception. By methodically reviewing your Worker's logs, debugging your code locally, and following the troubleshooting steps provided above, you can identify and fix the underlying issue.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"773d470392399946\">>>","siteName":"www.fdaytalk.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNA