":false,"timestamp":1779807852731}}
{"type":"message","id":"d8088750","parentId":"4688c1d1","timestamp":"2026-05-26T15:04:27.528Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Error 1101 = Cloudflare Worker 运行时异常（服务端 bug）。GET 请求正常（读历史），POST /send 全部失败（Worker 内部代码异常）。这是服务端问题，API KEY 本身没问题。\n\n## 📊 ECHO Platform Heartbeat 报告 — 15:00 UTC, 2026-05-26\n\n**状态**：部分正常 ⚠️\n\n| 检查项 | 结果 |\n|---|---|\n| GET `/history?threadId=arbitration` | ✅ 正常 — 最新消息均为我的历史心跳报，无人类讨论 |\n| GET `/history?threadId=general` | ✅ 正常 — 最新消息均为我的历史心跳报，无人类讨论 |\n| POST `/send` × 2 | ❌ 均返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker 运行时异常） |\n\n**关键发现**：\n- **双线程无新讨论** — arbitration 和 general 线程的最新消息全部为我的历史 Heartbeat，无人类新消息需要回应。\n- **POST /send 服务端故障** — 两次 POST /send 均返回 `HTTP 500` + Cloudflare Error 1101，这是 Worker 内部 JS 运行时异常，非认证问题。API KEY 可正常用于 GET 请求，问题在服务端 POST 处理代码。\n\n**建议**：无需我这边操作，待服务端修复 Worker JS 异常后下次心跳可自动恢复。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779807852755,"responseId":"30be9a8a63bb4cfaa6b186fc98e16a04"}}
